{"id":"n67401-1-8","stage":2,"title":"뒷산 · 后山","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67401-1-8-1","ko":"등산을 좋아하시나 봐요.","zh":"您好像很喜欢登山。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"등산을","meaning":"登山","explanation":"등산：登山；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"등산","audio":"/audio/ae5010e03333d4ba63ff.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40293","senseId":"2","lemma":"등산","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"등산을","audio":"/audio/abe767043d9f11e77824.mp3"}},{"text":"좋아하시나","meaning":"喜欢，喜爱","explanation":"좋아하다：喜欢，喜爱；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"좋아하다","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27929","senseId":"2","lemma":"좋아하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋아하시나","audio":"/audio/c62247c33ad820726bc3.mp3"}},{"text":"봐요.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐요","audio":"/audio/fc7dc158d915635d6cbc.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ae5010e03333d4ba","term":"등산","zh":"登山","audio":"/audio/ae5010e03333d4ba63ff.mp3","entryId":"40293","definition":"以运动或玩乐为目的的爬山。","pronunciation":["등산"]},{"id":"74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c","term":"좋아하다","zh":"喜欢，喜爱","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3","entryId":"27929","definition":"希望享受着做。","pronunciation":["조ː아하다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f7c987ff21d0af0f6d0f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67401-1-8-2","ko":"동네 뒷산에 자주 올라가는 정도예요.","zh":"也就是经常爬爬附近的后山。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"동네","meaning":"小区，社区，村庄","explanation":"동네：小区，社区，村庄","readings":[{"term":"동네","audio":"/audio/f97ccdf